## Failure containment and verification

Pre-mortem: valid Person list masks failed Employment; namesake relation misjoins; read permission exposes mutation; stale draft becomes new command; fragment/label leaks denied record; shared styles break320px. Detect via six SSR tests, retained existing suite, actual rendered browser at320px/200%/keyboard/Korean long names after root build, screenshots and independent critique. Rollback only new module/delegation in a forward change, preserving historical tests/evidence. Stop on changed DTO authority, unknown transport, generated-root conflict, or input/receipt semantics requiring unreviewed changes. No full People lifecycle or production qualification claim from this UI module.
